559	     * Whether an existing owner has been soft-deleted. A soft-deleted owner retains its row but is
560	     * ignored by the create endpoint's duplicate and identity checks, so a normally-blocking match
561	     * against a deleted owner is allowed.
562	     *
563	     * @param owner an existing owner
564	     * @return {@code true} when the owner is flagged deleted
565	     */
566	    private boolean isDeleted(Owner owner) {
567	        return Boolean.TRUE.equals(owner.getDeleted());
